    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to bring to the market this 3 bedroom mid terraced house located in the popular and well established area of Newcastle. 4 Newcastle Manor Rise comes to the market vacant and ready to move in.\n\nThis property offers well proportioned and versatile accommodation throughout and would make an ideal home for first time buyers, families or investors. \n\nNumber 4 briefly comprises of a entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining area, 3 bedroom and 3 bathroom. This property also benefits from a private rear garden and off street parking.\n\nBright and spacious throughout this property offers a comfortable layout with the potential for the new owner to put their own stamp on the property and create a comfortable and welcoming home. \n\nIdeally situated, No.4 is within walking distance to all local amenities, including shops, schools, childcare facilities and parks. There is easy access to the City Centre with an excellent bus network on the doorstep and also the N7, M50 & N4 motorways are close by. 4 Newcastle manor rise represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well located home within the sough after location of Newcastle. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential of this property. \n\n150 m to 68 & 6W Bus ( Luas link bus)\n450 m to Newcastle Supervalu\n450 m to Newcastle Spar\n700 m to St Finians School\n800 m to Newcastle Lidl\n900 m to Graydon Park\n4.2 km to Hazelhatch Train Station\n6.1 km to Celbridge Village\n8.3 km to Lucan\n12 km to Maynooth University via the 6w Bus\n16 km to Grafton Street Dublin\n22 km to Dublin Airport\nAll distances are approximate.\n\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n "
      },
